# Clay render of the Khronos "Car Concept" glTF model (tools/fetch_models.sh):
# one matte material for every part, under a uniform grey sky and a large soft
# sun from the upper left. Without color and reflections only the shape is
# left, which is how designers judge a body, and it shows import problems
# (holes, flipped normals) at once.

image_width  960
aspect_ratio 16/9
samples_per_pixel 64
max_depth    16

camera lookfrom 5.5 1.6 6.5  lookat 0 0.55 0.2  vfov 30

sky uniform 0.6 0.6 0.6
sun elevation 55 azimuth 210 intensity 2 angle 20
tonemap aces

material clay lambertian 0.75 0.75 0.75
ground clay

mesh ../models/external/CarConcept.glb clay
